# Keep the vendored Nayuki source byte-for-byte identical to its pinned upstream.
# `-text` disables end-of-line conversion in both directions, so the checked-out
# file hashes to the pinned SHA-256 on every platform. Without it, Windows
# checkouts convert to CRLF and the CI encoder-checksum gate fails there.
qrcodegen.py -text whitespace=-blank-at-eol
